---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us & Our Integrated Security Model | Security Services Australia"
  description="Learn about Security Services Australia: Our mission, national footprint, Grade A1 operations centre, leadership, and ISO quality accreditations."
>
  <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy-darkest) 0%, var(--navy-dark) 100%); color: #ffffff; padding: 5rem 0 4rem 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="badge-tag dark">About Security Services</div>
      <h1 style="color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Protecting Australia's Future</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--gray-300); max-width: 750px; font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.6;">
        For over two decades, Security Services has delivered integrated security architecture combining elite vetted personnel, autonomous surveillance tech, and 24/7 command operations.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section style="padding: 6rem 0; background: #ffffff;">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: center;">
        <div>
          <span class="badge-tag">Our Integrated Philosophy</span>
          <h2 style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">People, Process, and Technology in Perfect Synergy</h2>
          <p style="color: var(--gray-700); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
            Traditional security companies often rely solely on physical guarding or disconnected electronic hardware. At Security Services, we pioneer an **Integrated Security Ecosystem** where every licensed officer, mobile patrol vehicle, and solar CCTV tower is linked directly to our Grade A1 National Operations Centre (NOC).
          </p>
          <p style="color: var(--gray-700); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
            When an AI camera detects a perimeter breach or a door duress sensor triggers, our NOC operators verify the threat in under 15 seconds, initiate live talk-down deterrence, and dispatch our nearest GPS-tracked mobile patrol unit simultaneously.
          </p>

          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem;">
            <div style="border-left: 3px solid var(--primary-red); padding-left: 1rem;">
              <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--navy-dark);">ASIAL Certified</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--gray-600);">Master Security Corporate Member upholding strict industry ethics.</p>
            </div>
            <div style="border-left: 3px solid var(--primary-red); padding-left: 1rem;">
              <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--navy-dark);">Triple ISO Certified</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--gray-600);">ISO 9001 (Quality), ISO 45001 (Safety), ISO 14001 (Environment).</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; max-width: 500px; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;">
          <img src="/images/control_room_500x500.jpg" alt="National Operations Centre Control Room" width="500" height="500" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Core Leadership & Values -->
  <section style="padding: 6rem 0; background: var(--gray-50);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="badge-tag">Our Foundational Pillars</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Values That Drive Every Shift</h2>
      </div>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2rem;">
        <div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 2.25rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);">
          <div style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">🛡️</div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Vigilance & Integrity</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--gray-600); line-height: 1.6;">
            We operate with radical transparency. All patrol visits and guard checkpoints are verified electronically with digital GPS timestamps and client portal transparency.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 2.25rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);">
          <div style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">⚡</div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Uncompromising Speed</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--gray-600); line-height: 1.6;">
            In high-stakes security incidents, seconds count. Our sub-15s NOC triage and nationwide fleet routing ensure fastest possible physical arrival.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 2.25rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);">
          <div style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">🤝</div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Client Partnership</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--gray-600); line-height: 1.6;">
            We don't just supply guards; we become your trusted risk advisor with assigned Account Directors and quarterly security optimization reviews.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
